OL,3,AHarvey Weinstein sentenced to 15 years
OL,4,Ain prison for sexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FWeinstein has already spent several
OL,7,Fyears jailed in New York while he has
OL,8,Ffaced three trials in New York over
OL,9,Frape and abuse allegations. He has a
OL,10,Fseparate conviction for sex crimes in
OL,11,FLos Angeles.
